Description:
 edulution-linbo-vdi - VDI service for linuxmuster.net on Proxmox
Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.1.11) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * School-qualified LINBO group ids (closes #44): a VDI group named
     <school>__<group> takes its school from the id and matches devices.csv
     by the plain group. An id is qualified only if that school has its own
     devices.csv; plain groups work as before.
   * A VDI group of a non-default school from before per-school groups moves
     to <school>__<group> once linuxmuster-import-devices has created that
     start.conf. The service moves its .vdi file once (never overwriting),
     keeps the old one as a hidden backup, and keeps its masters and clones.
   * vdi-setup names a group of another school <school>__<group> when the
     installed linuxmuster-tools supports it; VM names keep the plain group.
